g-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T05:47:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami tops Virginia Tech, to face Wake Forest in ACC title game","description":"Miami will play Wake Forest in the ACC title game on Dec. 5 after both teams won on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-22T04:46:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558418/miami-tops-virginia-tech-face-wake-forest-acc-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Betting buzz: Big Ten's odds of national champion four-peat getting slim","description":"Losses by UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State make the Big Ten's chances of winning the national championship this season a long shot.","published":"2026-11-22T04:06:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/49921234/college-football-betting-buzz-odds-updates-line-moves-spreads","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5226976/romanas-frederique-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OJ_Frederique_Jr."},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"OJ Frederique Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OJ_Frederique_Jr.","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:34Z","intro":"Romanas 'OJ' Frederique Jr. is an American college football cornerback for the Miami Hurricanes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Frederique attended St. Thomas Aquinas High School in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. Coming out of high school, he was rated as a three-star recruit and held offers from schools such as Florida State, Miami, Ole Miss, UCF, and West Virginia. Frederique committed to play college football for the West Virginia Mountaineers. However, he flipped his commitment to the Miami Hurricanes."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Frederique got his first career start in week two of the 2024 season, where he recorded two tackles and a pass deflection in a win over Florida A&M. In week nine, he recorded a tackle and a pass deflection in a win over Florida State. In week 11, Frederique tallied five tackles and two pass deflections in a loss to Georgia Tech."}]}}